      "text": "530052"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "SurroundingArea",
      "text": "With a stay at Leonardo Royal Hotel London City - Tower of London, you\u0027ll be centrally located in London, within a 10-minute walk of Tower of London and Tower Bridge.  This spa hotel is 1.3 mi (2.1 km) from Borough Market and 1.3 mi (2.1 km) from Globe Theatre."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RoomTypes",
      "text": "Stay in one of 307 guestrooms featuring LCD televisions. Complimentary wired and wireless internet access keeps you connected, and cable programming provides entertainment. Private bathrooms with shower/tub combinations feature designer toiletries and hair dryers. Conveniences include phones, as well as safes and desks."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PropertyInformation",
      "text": "Relax at the full-service spa, where you can enjoy massages, body treatments, and facials. You\u0027re sure to appreciate the recreational amenities, including a health club, an indoor pool, and a sauna. Additional amenities at this hotel include complimentary wireless internet access, concierge services, and wedding services."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "AreaActivities",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003EThe Gherkin - 0.6 km / 0.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Tower of London - 0.7 km / 0.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Sky Garden - 0.7 km / 0.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Tower Bridge - 0.8 km / 0.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Liverpool Street - 0.9 km / 0.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Brick Lane - 1.1 km / 0.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Thames River - 1.1 km / 0.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Borough Market - 1.4 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E The Shard - 1.5 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E London Bridge - 1.8 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Globe Theatre - 1.8 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E St. Paul\u0027s Cathedral - 1.9 km / 1.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Barbican Arts Centre - 2 km / 1.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Tate Modern - 2.1 km / 1.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E King\u0027s College London - 2.6 km / 1.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003ELondon City Airport (LCY) - 12.3 km / 7.6 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Heathrow Airport (LHR) - 30.9 km / 19.2 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Gatwick Airport (LGW) - 85.3 km / 53 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Luton Airport (LTN) - 90.9 km / 56.5 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Stansted Airport (STN) - 60.5 km / 37.6 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PoliciesDisclaimers",
      "text": "\u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EExtra-person charges may apply and vary depending on property policy\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGovernment-issued photo identification and a credit card, debit card, or cash deposit may be required at check-in for incidental charges\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpecial requests are subject to availability upon check-in and may incur additional charges; special requests cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpecial cancellation policies or charges may apply for group reservations (more than 8 rooms for the same property / stay dates)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property accepts credit cards, debit cards, and cash\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EOnly registered guests are allowed in the guestrooms. \u003C/li\u003E \u003Cli\u003EThe property has connecting/adjoining rooms, which are subject to availability and can be requested by contacting the property using the number on the booking confirmation. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EContactless check-out is available.\u003C/li\u003E \u003C/ul\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "DiningFacilities",
      "text": "Stop by Forum Restaurant for lunch, dinner, or brunch, where this restaurant specializes in Mediterranean cuisine. Dining is also available at the coffee shop/cafe, and 24-hour room service is provided. Wrap up your day with a drink at the bar/lounge. Buffet breakfasts are served on weekdays from 6:30 AM to 10:00 AM for a fee."
    }
  ],
